🚨NEW: How Medicare For All Transformed America’s Biggest Senate Race

@MalloryMcMorrow began parroting Hillary Clinton’s opposition to Medicare For All — and then she quickly plummeted in polls &amp; was blasted out of the race.

A huge cautionary tale for corporate Dems 👇

